甲轮廓。\n5. **腿部护甲**：展示护胫、膝甲、腿部防具或裙甲结构，突出可活动关节与分件设计。\n6. **靴子**：展示成对靴子，强调鞋底、绑带、金属包边或毛绒内衬等细节。\n7. **手套/护手**：展示一对手套或护手甲，突出手背装甲、指节结构与袖口过渡。\n8. **披风/斗篷**：展示披风整体展开或垂挂状态，体现布料垂坠感、边缘装饰与背部连接点。\n9. **武器**：展示武器完整形态，可为单手/双手武器，突出材质、锋刃、握把与装饰细节。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "NPC提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [416.9076232910156, 590.5601196289062], "pos": [774.0800170898438, 0], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3079.4951171875, 171.5588836669922], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [594.65625, -221.5588836669922], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 43, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "每天登录还有100币  邀请码：【f9jnhfgd】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff29f8"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4276.55517578125, 259.30816650390625], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-30, -581.2376098632812], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 44, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【f9jnhfgd】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fec806"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [54], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["anima_baseV10.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO"